[OC][L 34.07,55 Ashenvale][L 36.26,59.53 Ashenvale][L 37.53,64.17 Ashenvale][L 41.98,67.39 Ashenvale][L 32.01,54.29 Ashenvale][L 30.16,51.93 Ashenvale]TIP: You can pre place a *Freezing Trap* in front of you before you pull the mob to tame to take less damage \\ *Ashenvale Bears* spawn closer to the Talondeep Path, *Ghostpaw Runners* share spawns with *Wildthorn Stalkers* which spawn south and west of Astranaar \\ If you can't find any wolves try to use *Eagle Eye* to look for one \\ Cast *Tame Beast* on a *Ashenvale Bear*. Attack mobs with it to learn *Claw (Rank 3)* \\ Cast *Tame Beast* on a *Ghostpaw Runner*. Attack mobs with it to learn *Bite (Rank 3)* \\ Click here for more info about pet training: https://www.wow-petopia.com/classic/training.php
