[OC][L 69.92,71.43 Ashenvale][L 71.02,68.69 Ashenvale]Be careful about *Horde Guards* as you're making your way to Azshara. Theres two camps of guards (marked on your map) near the road next to Splintertree outpost that you can bodypull if not careful \\ Use *Track Humanoids* and watch your minimap to more easily spot where the guards are located[TAR12903-]
