[G 11.9,77.57 Azshara][L 69.92,71.43 Ashenvale][L 71.02,68.69 Ashenvale]Be careful about *Horde Guards* as you're making your way to Azshara. Theres two camps of guards (marked on your map) near the road next to Splintertree outpost that you can bodypull if not careful \\ You may encounter a *Warsong Outrider* patrolling the road north-east of Splintertree Post. You don't have to run around it as it's passive and will not attack you if you don't attack it first \\ Use *Track Humanoids* and watch your minimap to more easily spot where the guards are located \\ Talk to *Jarrodenus* \\ Get the [P Azshara] flight path[TAR12903-][TAR12577-]
